/* 
This do file estimates manager fixed effects on their subordinates' pay outcomes, and classifies managers into high-flyer managers based on different threshold values.

Input:
    "${TempData}/R3_Point1_EmployeePanelUsedForMngrFE.dta"  <== created in Point1_FE_01 do file 

Output: 
    "${TempData}/R3_Point1_FE_HFMeasure_PayMngrFEBased.dta"

RA: WWZ 
Time: 2025-08-12
*/

*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??
*?? step 1. estimating manager FE
*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??

use "${TempData}/R3_Point1_EmployeePanelUsedForMngrFE.dta", clear 

/* keep if inrange(_n, 1, 20000) */
    // used for testing the codes

reghdfe LogPayBonus i.YearMonth, absorb(IDlse PayFE=IDlseMHR)

*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??
*?? step 2. classifying into high- and low-flyer managers
*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??*??

*-? s-3-1. keep a cross-section of managers

keep IDlseMHR PayFE
keep if PayFE!=.
duplicates drop 

*-? s-3-2. generate relevant percentile values 

pctile pctile_PayFE = PayFE, nquantiles(10)
global PayFE_50p = pctile_PayFE[5]
global PayFE_60p = pctile_PayFE[6]
global PayFE_70p = pctile_PayFE[7]

*-? s-3-3. create 3 HF indicators

generate FE50 = (PayFE >= ${PayFE_50p})
generate FE40 = (PayFE >= ${PayFE_60p})
generate FE30 = (PayFE >= ${PayFE_70p})

*-? s-3-4. generate variables used for further merge 

keep IDlseMHR PayFE FE50 FE40 FE30
rename IDlseMHR IDMngr
foreach var in IDMngr FE50 FE40 FE30 {
    generate `var'_Pre = `var'
    generate `var'_Post = `var'
}

save "${TempData}/R3_Point1_FE_HFMeasure_PayMngrFEBased.dta", replace